    "detailed_description": "When an evil teddy bear wields dark magic to corrupt all the other toys in the house, it's up to HANK to defend his home before his family returns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Toy-sized Chaos: Experience the world from the perspective of a pint-sized robot in this unique first-person shooter. Engage in fun battles against possessed toy robots, Jack in the boxes and more as you navigate through your house. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Arsenal of Destruction: Hank may be small, but he packs a punch! Upgrade Hank's weaponry, from high-tech lasers to explosive rocket launchers. Unleash devastating firepower on your enemies, turning them into scrap metal in style. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Fun Boss Fights: From a evil vacuum cleaner, to a teddy bear in a tank fight your way through each level to eventually fight the boss!<br />\r\nPress F - To change fire mode<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMade by a two man team using Unreal 5.",
    "about_the_game": "When an evil teddy bear wields dark magic to corrupt all the other toys in the house, it's up to HANK to defend his home before his family returns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Toy-sized Chaos: Experience the world from the perspective of a pint-sized robot in this unique first-person shooter. Engage in fun battles against possessed toy robots, Jack in the boxes and more as you navigate through your house. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Arsenal of Destruction: Hank may be small, but he packs a punch! Upgrade Hank's weaponry, from high-tech lasers to explosive rocket launchers. Unleash devastating firepower on your enemies, turning them into scrap metal in style. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Fun Boss Fights: From a evil vacuum cleaner, to a teddy bear in a tank fight your way through each level to eventually fight the boss!<br />\r\nPress F - To change fire mode<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMade by a two man team using Unreal 5.",
